  id: 511eec43c5bb4406a80905d1b0720f31
  DisplayName: War Scare on the Rhine
  EventType: 1
  Description: Troops {are massing|are said to be massing} on both banks of the Rhine,
    and the papers {talk|will talk} of nothing but war. French and German families
    {are sending|will send} their collections abroad to be sold while they still
    can, the frontier roads {are choked|will be choked}, and no collector on either
    side of the river {is|will be} buying.
  DurationWeeks: 4
  MinLeadWeeks: 1
  MaxLeadWeeks: 5
